  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A photograph of a red brick corner building with a deli on Cortelyou Road in Brooklyn, with the awnings, lamp post, traffic light, a car and a figure outlined as flat cartoon shapes under a bright blue sky, signed 2023.",
    "description": "A portrait format digital piece on a photograph, signed Matt Crump 2023 at lower right. A curved four storey red brick building with cream stone trim stands on a corner under a clear blue sky, with a fire escape on its left face and a yellow brick building beside it at right. The deli at street level has blue shutters and its awnings are redrawn as flat white and cream shapes; the yellow building's cornice is redrawn in flat colour. A lamp post at left and a traffic light arm with yellow outlined signals are drawn over the photograph. A faceless figure in a white top walks at lower left, another sits in the deli doorway, an outlined grey bin stands by the pole, and a pale cartoon car with a blue window sits at right. The street and crosswalks fill the lower third with faint rainbow tyre marks.",
    "impression": "The quietest kind of Brooklyn corner, drawn with evident affection: the building is allowed to be itself and the drawing just tidies the awnings and the signals. The wide empty street gives it room to breathe. A portrait of a building more than a scene.",
